rong>Random Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face random events that can either challenge or benefit your sect. Adapt your strategies to weather natural disasters or seize unexpected opportunities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/7b22789a7d5a704aa931cc5796c5fab1.poster.avif?t=1760829221\" width=587 height=469 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/extras/7b22789a7d5a704aa931cc5796c5fab1.webm?t=1760829221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey as a sect leader has just begun. Build a strong, prosperous sect, guide your disciples wisely, and cultivate a legacy that will be remembered for generations.</p>","developers":["Alena Selezneva"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438530/header.jpg?t=1760829221","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3438530/840492/b1d75fc0e10089e9390e752cc655fed2d0742c7e/1750851005/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742945120","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3438530/840492/b1d75fc0e10089e9390e752cc655fed2d0742c7e/1750851005/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742945120","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3438530/840492/b1d75fc0e